      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>July 22, 2025</color>\nSandrone, Fatui Harbinger. Codename: \"Marionette\"\n\"The Frostmoon Scions, again? Hah... A laughably futile rebellion.\"\n<color=#ffacff>HoYoLAB:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/www.hoyolab.com/article/40132513</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Character Announcement"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/05/25/151578876/7c0451ce701c443a9c6b2dc135ab2704_3942376631597550726.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>May 25, 2026</color>\n\"This world is beautiful, more beautiful than you or I can imagine. So go. Do what you want to do, and seek out your own desires, my child. Just remember, your life belongs to you.\"\n— Alain Guillotin's last words\n<color=#ffacff>HoYoLAB:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/www.hoyolab.com/article/45197167</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "Character Illustrations",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Version Luna I - \"A Dance of Snowy Tides and Hoarfrost Groves\""
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/12/15/35428890/4704dd659a37c4a4e32cf509d50f7b4c_6816549379192338730.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/12/15/35428890/70a883b01e08ef4940d467aba399af17_3220845552049407684.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>October 9, 2025</color>\n<color=#ffacff>HoYoLAB:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/www.hoyolab.com/article/41624637</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Version Luna III - \"A Nocturne of the Far North\""
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/18/35428890/9253bff747d5a9381830165d51a70aa1_2072792265739635530.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>December 23, 2025</color>\n<color=#ffacff>HoYoLAB:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/www.hoyolab.com/article/42891566</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Christmas 2025"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/18/35428890/87731eafa0c8bad3aadcb367a8320155_7514903289218395151.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>December 25, 2025</color>\nWhile the snow outside is still falling,\nand as the sweet fragrance of cake fills the room,\nand the wine glass in my hand is still warm to the touch...\nHere's to the winter night, to this very moment, and to every brilliant day that lies ahead.\n<color=#ffacff>HoYoLAB:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/www.hoyolab.com/article/42909755</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Version Luna IV - \"A Traveler on a Winter's Night\""
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/08/151578876/ab8c632b5d5748ccf5ca10bf60abbc22_5058883121151178745.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>February 5, 2026</color>\n<color=#ffacff>HoYoLAB:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/www.hoyolab.com/article/43631587</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Cat Day 2026"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/05/25/151578876/10b74897ccd5a4c69cf436c3d289875a_6860243102977342803.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>February 22, 2026</color>\n<color=#ece5d8>[Translated from Japanese]</color>\n\"Meow, meow...♪\"\n\"You're not a child... If that's okay with you, then I don't mind.\"\n<color=#80bfff>X:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/x.com/Genshin_7/status/2025374989684539520</color>"
